so  a warm welcome to all of the gamers  tuning in from around the world  and a big thank you to all of our  partners and resellers who support  selling the amd radeon brand  watching this today i'm excited to be  here with you and share the details of a  brand new radeon graphics gpu  we are so happy that so many of you  share our passion for gaming  this passion has been going on strong  for over 30 years  throughout these years we have been  standing by our core values of  innovation and open standards bringing  you new gaming products and technologies  all while making them widely accessible  at its core the video game industry has  been about innovation  new technologies new games and new  experiences are expected every year  so it should be no surprise to anyone  that with the introduction of new  processors  graphics cards and gaming consoles 2020  was the biggest year ever for the gaming  industry  there were 3.1 billion gamers last year  which is almost 40 percent of the  world's population  powering a 174 billion dollar gaming  industry  there is no doubt that pc console and  mobile gaming is one of the largest  entertainment industries  in the world leading up to today amd has  accelerated our investment  in gaming features to produce new  technologies that dramatically improve  your game play  in the short time since we introduced  our first generation amd rdna  architecture in the summer of 2019  we pioneered responsivity features known  as radeon anti-lag  which enables lower input latency for  competitive gaming  and radeon boost which encompasses the  input latency reduction of anti-lag  while also providing performance  increases anti-lag was available on all  dx9 and dx11 games  and boost was available on 8 popular  games by the end of 2019  we have been committed to developing  these features and have some exciting  enhancements  to talk to you about later on in 2020  we pioneered amd smart access memory  technology  we were the first company to seek out  and popularize the standard resizable  bar technology  and bring that performance benefit to pc  gamers around the world  we enabled additional performance in  many games for our ryzen 5000 series  desktop processors  and radeon rx 6000 series graphics cards  a lot of you have been asking us about  support on previous generation cpus  with amd smart access memory so today  we are announcing that in addition to  the ryzen 5000 series processors we will  be enabling  ryzen 3000 series processors to deliver  the same great performance improvements  of amd smart access memory technology  when paired with an amd radeon rx 6000  series graphics card  we love coming up with features like  this for gamers and we have a lot more  in store  last year we launched our radeon rx 6800  series and rx 6900 xt  graphics cards featuring the efficient  and feature-packed amd rdna 2  architecture  with amd rd and a2 we were able to hit  up to 65 percent  more performance per watt than the  previous amd rdna architecture  plus we built in all the latest  technologies and features  that gamers will use for years to come  the radeon rx 6900 xt rx 6800  xt and rx 6800 graphics cards are truly  next generation gpus built to deliver  full immersion in your latest games  allowing for maximum settings while  playing at 4k resolutions  today our amd rdna2 family of gpus is  growing  towards the end of 2020 we introduced  big navi which was affectionately named  by amd fans around the world  and now we are bringing the next step  down in our product stack to reach even  more gamers  we are proud to announce our latest amd  rdna2 gpu chip  the radeon rx 6700 xt designed  specifically to accelerate your gaming  experience at 1440p resolution  and of course at max settings over 95  of gamers in the world play on displays  that have 1440p resolution or below  and not surprisingly the 1440p  resolution is the fastest growing  monitor segment  that gamers are upgrading to with a 44  growth in sales year over year which is  why we built the rx 6700 xt to perform  extremely well  at this resolution perhaps more exciting  is that gamers are catching on to the  importance of having a high refresh rate  capable monitor  so that your gpu and monitor can take  advantage of every fast frame in highly  competitive games  the industry experienced over 98 percent  display shipment growth of 1440p  greater than 100 hertz refresh rate  monitors year over year  which is exactly why we built the rx  6700 xt  thermals and sound matter so we've  invested heavily in  every exquisite detail for maximum  results  the rx 6700 xt thermals are built to  handle large workloads cooling your gpu  while providing horsepower when you need  it  and is also whisper quiet when you don't  each rx 6700 xt made by amd  features a custom dual axial fan design  meant to deliver up to 50 percent  less perceived noise versus previous  blower designs  these cards feature the same 0 rpm fan  mode as the other rx 6000 series cards  to ensure the best operations in low  usage mods  underneath the cover we've optimized the  design around three heat pipes with fins  held securely in place with a single die  cast aluminum frame  the cards feature 11 phases for high  efficiency high performance at very high  clock speeds  to further ensure high performance each  card features two layers of two ounce  copper  within each tin layer pcb we use a high  performing  reliable phase change thermal interface  material for effective heat dissipation  and heat flow into the heat pipes these  boards feature 12 gigabytes of high  performance gddr6  support the latest pcie 4.0 motherboards  and standard edge based power connectors  last but not least the rx 6700 xt  supports displayport  1.4 and hdmi 2.1 for the latest high  refresh rate displays in the market  now that you've seen what's under the  hood let's take a look at performance  we know most of you today may still be  using graphics cards from three or four  years ago in your pcs  and are starting to see some challenging  performance in the latest games  in games like assassin's creed valhalla  borderlands 3  call of duty cyberpunk 2077 and even  dirt 5  cards like the nvidia gtx 1070 ti  struggle to get good performance at  1440p  with maximum settings even if you have a  more recent rtx 2080 super  you will find newer games challenging on  your gpu for playability  the radeon rx 6700 xt is a great upgrade  that will allow you to deliver high  frame rates at 1440p  with everything turned on in these  modern titles  let's also talk about future readiness  one of the reasons the rx 6700  xt is so great with modern titles is  because we've equipped the rx 6700xt  with 12 gigabytes of gddr6  to handle increasing texture loads and  greater visual demands that modern games  at higher resolutions  and max settings throughout your desktop  pc  games such as call of duty black ops  cold war dx12  ultra with high texture packs consume  approximately 11.1 gigabytes  dirt 5 and dx12 ultra high settings  consumes  9.5 gigabytes horizon zero dawn dx12  ultimate settings can easily use 10.4  gigabytes  and my favorite red dead redemption 2  vulcan  ultra 9.4 gigabytes with the amd radeon  rx 6700 xt  you can expect this new gpu to handle  today's demanding  aaa titles and those that will be  launched in the coming months  we've just looked at how the rx 6700xt  performs  relative to previous generation gpus now  let's see how it performs relative to  modern competition  as you can see in games like assassin's  creed valhalla  borderlands 3 hitman and many more the  radiant rx 6700 xt competes  exceptionally well for those of you who  want to try out ray tracing the radeon  rx 6700 xt  features 40 ray accelerators for full  directx ray tracing support  but ray tracing is just one part of our  visual initiative  and we are optimizing games alongside  other techniques in our amd fidelity fx  feature set  to allow for a complete high frame rate  experience  games like dirt 5  godfall world of warcraft shadowlands  and the rift breaker feature the latest  directx 12 ultimate techniques and  amd fidelity fx to bring both high  performance and enhanced immersion to  more games  amd fidelity fx is yet another example  of the power of open standards and  amd initiatives to improve the  experience of pc gaming for more gamers  the fidelity fx feature set includes a  variety of techniques that sharpen  denoise and add detail shadows and many  more visual enhancements to make your  games look better  it's a big reason why amd fidelity fx  with just two years of development  is already in over 40 games and counting  the next exciting title featuring both  ray tracing  and amd fidelity fx will be from our  partners at capcom  resident evil village the eighth major  entry in the resident evil series  demonstrates what is possible with ultra  realistic graphics  powered by the re engine and the latest  generation radeon rx 6000 series  graphics cards  the next generation of visuals for both  ray tracing and amd fidelity fx  really add to the atmosphere and  experience these games are known for  be sure to check out resident evil  village may 7 2021  as important as realistic visuals are we  know that competitive gamers who are  playing esports titles today  desire the best responsiveness latency  and smooth frame rate technologies  radeon anti-lag enables lower input  latency and radeon boost encompasses the  input latency reduction of anti-lag  while also providing performance  increases in select games  and these features along with amd  freesync technology can reduce lag  make games more responsive and enable  tear-free gaming  what's new with radeon anti-lag today is  that we've now added support for directx  12 which means anti-lag is available on  virtually  almost all popular games radeon boost is  now enhanced with the addition of  variable rate shading support  and an expanded list of supported games  that can take advantage of this feature  your goal in any competitive games is to  win  let's take a look at radeon boost in  action when you're in an intense matchup  you want to quickly target  and shoot the enemy before they notice  you enabling radeon boost will certainly  enhance  your ability to win in a 1v1 scenario we  achieve this by varying the shading rate  happening on screen  during that character movement without  noticeable image degradation  in the example here we have the radeon  rx 6700 xt  running fortnite averaging around 120  frames per second without boost enabled  by enabling radeon boost gamers can get  up to 150 frames per second or more  when your in-game character spins to  target and shoots at an opponent  instantly providing an increased  performance at the most critical time  another important piece of the ultimate  gaming experience is having a monitor  that matches the output of your graphics  card  amd freesync premium and freesync  premium pro monitors  are the perfect pairings for radeon rx  6700xt  enabling low latency high competitive  refresh rates  and smooth gaming last year alone we  certified nearly 250  premium and premium pro displays with  the high refresh rate freesync premium  displays  you will want a graphics card that can  deliver high frame rates  and the rx 6700 xt delivers that easily  in your favorite competitive games the  rx 6700 xt can easily drive the latest  165hz  1440p displays even if you've maxed out  all the visual settings  having the best hardware adds a  competitive advantage and by combining  the latest ryzen processors and radeon  graphics cards you unlock the full  performance potential of your rig  thanks to amd smart access memory radeon  anti-lag  and of course amd freesync technologies  we're so excited to announce that our  latest esports partner  taking advantage of this powerful  hardware combination is the mercedes amg  patronus esports team  their esports team has recently switched  their gaming rigs to an all amd platform  providing a highly optimized competitive  gaming experience  with the same kind of championship level  performance as seen on the grid  but now in virtual formula one amd ryzen  processors and radeon graphics together  provide high octane performance  responsibility for those hairpin turns  and the smoothest driving experience  during every second of gameplay  the combination of fast reaction times  with low latency is the difference  between winning  or finishing outside the podium we're  looking forward to seeing the team  achieve  great results in this year's upcoming  competitive season whether you're  playing the latest demanding games  at the top of the leaderboard and  carrying your team or enjoying the  latest in immersive visuals  the radeon rx 6700 xt is a fantastic  graphics card for you  now let's talk about availability  the amd radeon rx 6700 xt will be  available on march 18th  with an scp at 479 on amd.com  demand for gpus is at an all-time high  right now and in order to maximize  availability at launch  we are launching both made by amd  reference designs for sale on amd.com  and our aib partner designs at retailers  and retailers  across the globe on day one you'll be  able to purchase the radeon  rx 6700 xt at your favorite website  starting march 18th lastly for those who  do not want to build a pc for themselves  the rx 6700 xt is also available with  the ryzen 5000 series processor  from 40 plus system build partners  including the latest  hp omen pc launching later this month  we are excited to have the radeon rx  6700 xt  join the 6000 series family with next  generation technology advancements  future ready memory capability and  competitive software features  while 2021 is just getting started so  are we  expect even more rdna2 announcements  soon from us  to expand our family even further until  next time everyone  stay safe and have fun gaming  you

